epared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards Ind AS prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act 2013 the Act read with the relevant rules thereunder and in terms of Regulation 33 of Securities and Exchange Board of India Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements Regulations 2015 as amended  &lt;BR&gt; 
